{"seq":2,"slug":"patterns","title":"第二章：分布式消息模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"saga-choreography","title":"Saga 模式：分布式事务的编排与协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/saga-choreography","wordCount":929,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"event-sourcing-messaging","title":"事件溯源与消息系统集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/event-sourcing-messaging","wordCount":811,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"dead-letter-queue","title":"死信队列与消息错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/dead-letter-queue","wordCount":914,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第二章-分布式消息模式\">第二章：分布式消息模式</h1><p>本章聚焦三类核心分布式消息模式：Saga 编排、事件溯源与死信队列。这三个模式是构建可靠异步系统的骨干——Saga 解决跨服务事务，事件溯源用消息本身作为系统状态的持久化载体，死信队列则构建消息处理失败后的兜底体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心主题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"saga-choreography\">Saga 编排与协作模式</a></td>\n<td>分布式事务、补偿操作、两种 Saga 实现对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"event-sourcing-messaging\">事件溯源与消息集成</a></td>\n<td>事件日志作为状态源、Event Store、CQRS 结合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"dead-letter-queue\">死信队列与错误处理</a></td>\n<td>失败消息路由、重试策略、人工干预流程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本章前建议先完成第一章基础，理解消息投递语义（At-Least-Once/Exactly-Once）和幂等性设计，这些概念在 Saga 和死信队列中均有直接应用。</p>\n"}